spec.section:
## H.5 Explicitly unsupported

- direct agent/peer writes to `/chd/*`, `/sessions/*` or `/gaps/*`;
- shell/CLI worker launch as authority;
- webhook use for operations other than `signal_ingress`;
- binary image/PDF upload or content processing;
- blind SQLite copying into a replacement session;
- implicit human approval, automatic live policy resync, policy widening, or connectivity-as-VP;
- undocumented operation names, unversioned payloads, and generic envelopes standing in for typed contracts.


</div>
